l": "Schema drift check (prisma migrate diff --exit-code)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".github/workflows/main.yml", "source_location": "jobs.test-integration.steps['Check for missing migrations (schema drift)']", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Release checklist (issue #21): catches a schema.prisma edit that never got a migration. The live DB is migrated to head first, so diffing it against the schema must yield an empty patch. Without this gate a schema-only edit passes CI and then breaks `migrate deploy` in production, where there is no `db push` escape hatch."}, {"id": "_github_workflows_main_game_core_coverage_gate", "label": "game-core coverage gate in CI", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".github/workflows/main.yml", "source_location": "jobs.test.steps['Run game-core coverage gate']", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "game-core is the single source of truth for money and production formulas, so it carries its own 80% coverage gate (issue #21). It has no DB dependency, so the gate lives in the DB-free unit job rather than beside the bot's services gate. Deliberately NOT `--affected`: the threshold must hold on every PR, not only when the package is touched."}, {"id": "_github_workflows_main_dummy_database_url", "label": "Dummy CI DATABASE_URL for prisma generate", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".github/workflows/main.yml", "source_location": "env.DATABASE_URL", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Prisma generate runs inside the build DAG, so a dummy postgres URL is exported globally to stop the generator reaching for a real database. The test-integration job overrides it at job level with a `*-dev` database because tests/integration/setup.ts refuses any non-dev DB."}, {"id": "_github_workflows_main_turbo_remote_cache", "label": "Turborepo remote cache credentials", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".github/workflows/main.yml", "source_location": "env.TURBO_TOKEN / env.TURBO_TEAM", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "_github_workflows_main_ci", "target": "_github_workflows_main_quality", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".github/workflows/main.yml", "source_location": "jobs.quality", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_github_workflows_main_test", "target": "_github_workflows_main_quality", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".github/workflows/main.yml", "source_location": "jobs.test.needs", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_github_workflows_main_test_integration", "target": "_github_workflows_main_quality", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".github/workflows/main.yml", "source_location": "jobs.test-integration.needs", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_github_workflows_main_build", "target": "_github_workflows_main_quality", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".github/workflows/main.yml", "source_location": "jobs.build.needs", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_github_workflows_main_test", "target": "_github_workflows_main_game_core_coverage_gate", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".github/workflows/main.yml", "source_location": "jobs.test.steps", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_github_workflows_main_test_integration", "target": "_github_workflows_main_schema_drift_check", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".github/workflows/main.yml", "source_location": "jobs.test-integration.steps", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_github_workflows_main_schema_drift_check", "target": "_github_workflows_main_prisma", "relation": "conceptually_r